/**
@mainpage

`libfun` is my sandbox library for C utilities. It is not currently
production-ready, and probably never will; it simply houses various
implementations I find useful.

To integrate this library to your build system, see @ref README.md


@section public_api_sec Public API

The library provides the following modules:
- `hmap.h`: A hashmap implementation using open addressing and the FNV hash
            function.
- `map.h`: An ordered map implementation using augmented Red-Black trees. TODO:
           add this feature back
- `stack.h`: A standard LIFO stack.


